cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this procedure, please cite both it and the paper that studied it."
title: "An XRR fitting procedure for a laboratory LLM agent"
abstract: >-
  A written procedure for fitting a measured X-ray reflectivity curve, elicited from an expert at the
  keyboard and written so that a language-model agent can follow it without further instruction.
  Thirteen numbered sections, a 22-item report template, and the laboratory's constants marked in place.
